## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, premium wedding website designer, UI/UX specialist, frontend animation engineer, and database architect.

Build a complete, production-oriented Vietnamese online wedding invitation website inspired by the two attached reference files.

This is a real application, not a static mockup, UI concept, landing page screenshot, or prototype.

You must implement:
- A visually faithful recreation of the supplied wedding invitation design.
- An elegant interactive wedding card opening experience.
- Background music that starts when the guest opens the invitation.
- A complete, responsive, long-form wedding invitation website.
