## 3.2. Opening interaction

When the guest clicks "Mở thiệp":

1. Play an elegant opening animation.
2. Transition smoothly from the closed invitation card to the main wedding website.
3. Start the selected background music.
4. Reveal the invitation content with subtle motion.
